  _lines:
  - That's very mature of you.
  - Now, these last couple questions are ones I have to ask every patient. Your answer
    won't affect anything right away, but it will be used to inform how your treatment
    will continue going forward.
  - Hopefully that makes sense.
  - First, have you ever made, or acted on plans to hurt yourself?
